Unsurprisingly, even an outstanding mobile FPS makes quite a lousy PC title. You can feel it's a port on almost every step, through some mechanics, controls, pacing, etc. The game is pretty boring, level layout very basic and playing it actually feels like a chore.
It is quite cheap, so maybe you'll be able to extract some entertainment value out of it... but then again, if you want some zombies in space, for the same price of 5$ you can grab DOOM3 (and for the love of goat,
), download some graphics mods for it and you'll get a much, much better and longer gaming experience.
